---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
import {site} from '../data/site';
interface Props { placement: 'home' | 'news'; wide?: boolean }
const {placement, wide = false} = Astro.props;
---
<aside class:list={['x-profile', {'x-profile-wide': wide}]} aria-label="KUMC公式X">
  <div class="x-profile-icon" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.901 1.153h3.68l-8.04 9.19L24 22.846h-7.406l-5.8-7.584-6.64 7.584H.47l8.6-9.835L0 1.154h7.594l5.243 6.932 6.064-6.933Zm-1.29 19.46h2.039L6.487 3.24H4.3z"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="x-profile-copy">
    <p class="section-label">FOLLOW US</p>
    <h2><span>Xでも活動を</span><span>発信しています。</span></h2>
    <p>例会やイベントのお知らせ、日々の活動を公式Xでお届けします。</p>
  </div>
  <a href={site.x} class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-event="social_click" data-platform="x" data-placement={placement}><span>KUMC_Xのプロフィールを見る</span> <Arrow external/></a>
</aside>
